GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?code={{master_key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 25. Update user role with regular user token (should return 403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/role?code={{master_key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "SOME_USER_ID",
  "newRole": "Admin"
}
